<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The lead you own {!Lead.Name} from {!Lead.Company} in the MQL Stage, with priority of {!Lead.Core_Lead_Priority__c} must be contacted.</font></div><div style=""><br></div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Click&nbsp;</span><a href="{!Lead.Link}"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">here</font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></a><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">to visit this lead record in SFDC</span></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">As a reminder, the following SLA is expected for MQL lead assigned to you:</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(&lt;Lead Priority&gt; if Hot): Lead Status must attempt contact within 1 business day.&nbsp; Initial Activity (Email or Phone Call) must be logged the following business day.</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(&lt;Lead Priority&gt; if Warm): Lead Status must attempt contact within 2 business days.&nbsp; Initial Activity (Email or Phone Call) must be logged the following business day.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(&lt;Lead Priority&gt; if Cold): Lead Status must attempt contact within 4 business days.&nbsp; Initial Activity (Email or Phone Call) must be logged the following business day.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please process your lead by updating the Lead Status and Sub Status as soon as possible. Non processed Leads will be reflected in reporting for Action.</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Leads move to a terminated state if there is no activity for 30 days and 90 days since the creation date.</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you.</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>